clear and functional. Scenes 3 through 8, however, are functionally
interchangeable — rest stop, minor bicker, small discovery, repeat — with
no rising stakes, no new information, and no scene that could not be
deleted or reordered without changing the story. Meant to read as a
plausible early-career draft: competent hiking-trip dialogue, just no
